WEBVTT

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:10.070
We're fighting right now in the galaxy soccer tournament, Grand Celesta Galaxy.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:15.130
As we aim to be best in the universe, we head to the next planet.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.650
The planet Kieru that you speak of has long been destroyed.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.580
Receiving contact from there is unthinkable.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.770
Destroyed?

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:28.880
How would you know that?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:31.750
Because...

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.340
I am from that planet.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.810
That planet...?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.550
I am an alien.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.610
An alien?

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.310
What do you mean?

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:53.900
You can't expect us to simply believe you.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.150
Very well then.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:57.780
I will prove it to you.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:04.370
A-A doll?

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:50.270
Now I will begi-

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:51.980
Mizukawa-san!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:54.990
What's wrong, Mizukawa-san?

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:58.060
Hey, why did she fall asleep?

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.990
She's not pretending that she fell asleep, is she?

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.450
Of course not.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.600
Was that a... voice?

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:08.540
Y-Yeah...

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.830
I-It moved!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.460
Hello, everyone.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:15.960
How do you do.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:17.920
I-It talked!

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.850
My name is Potomuri.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.970
I am not from Earth.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:26.450
As of now, I exist as only a soul.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:32.940
I have joined with you to participate in this fight by sharing Mizukawa Minori's body.

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.060
This... can't be real...

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.390
W-What the heck is going on?!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:39.150
Why have you joined us?!

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:40.610
Well.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:49.490
My planet was destroyed in the past by the appearance of a black hole, as is now.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:59.590
Right before my planet was sucked into the black hole and destroyed, I alone managed to escape from my home planet.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.050
Just you?

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:09.720
However, my escape failed and, as a result, I lost my physical body.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.880
U-Um, but...

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:15.430
Doesn't losing your physical body mean you're dead?

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.730
That means you're a ghost!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.860
Well, let's leave it at that for now.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:30.270
As a spirit, I wandered the galaxy until I arrived at Earth.

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:37.310
By then, I was hanging on by barely even a thread of consciousness.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.670
The soul gradually vanishes without a body to dwell in.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:49.910
Therefore, I used the last, feeble remnants of my power to save this girl's dying life...

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:54.130
...while at the same time, using her body to extend my own.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:58.710
So that my spirit does not end up rooted to Minori's body,

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:05.450
I have preserved my spirit by alternatively dwelling between this doll and her body.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:13.700
Without any idea on my purpose in life, I simply existed each day.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:20.190
Then one day, I felt the presence of someone like me arriving down from space.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:24.050
And that was Ozrock.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:28.340
I felt as if it was destiny.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:32.150
Earth is very similar to my planet.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:37.900
I began to think that perhaps my reason for being alive was so I could save Earth.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:41.730
The name of my planet is Kieru.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:45.610
The lady Katora is the princess of my home planet.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.990
Then could Katora have survived, too?

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:52.090
Impossible.

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:56.960
There were no signs of anyone other than myself having escaped.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:06.720
Immediately before I escaped, I saw Kieru disappear into the black hole with my very eyes.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:10.930
The princess that you saw could only have been an illusion.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:14.470
But I never even heard her name before.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:22.440
Perhaps you heard the whisperings of rumors about her in a town somewhere, and that appeared before you as an apparition.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:26.370
Ever since we made contact and began socializing with other planets within the galaxy,

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:31.540
there are very few who do not know of either our planet Kieru or Princess Katora.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.910
Is that so...?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:40.880
Mizukawa-san!

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.000
Who the hell are you guys?!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.380
What the hell is going on?!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.340
Oh no!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.760
That's better.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:01.060
I-I have no idea...

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.360
...what is going on anymore...

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.510
Pardon me.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:11.660
Mizukawa Minori's own personality appears when I am not in possession of her body.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:16.010
So, from what we just saw, she's really a delinquent?

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:19.960
She was apparently quite the troublemaker in school as well.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:22.800
Wait a sec! By Mizukawa Minori, you don't mean...

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.780
That glare in her eyes, I remember now!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:29.970
Who we just saw must have been the Mizukawa who's otherwise known as the Minotaur of Iwashiro Junior High! {岩城中}

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:38.680
While I am in her body, our spiritual states are fused together.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:42.920
This means that I am someone who is both different from myself and from Mizukawa Minori.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.010
Someone who is both male and female.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.790
Both adult and child.

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:05.880
Kyousuke Tsurugi, is it?

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:10.380
I am Lalaya, Queen of Falam Orbius.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.470
What is it you're planning to do with me?

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.120
Nothing at all.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.500
I simply want you to serve me.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.970
Serve you? Me?

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.530
That's right.

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.270
You will be mine.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.500
I refuse.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.050
Refuse?

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.950
You don't have a choice.

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:31.610
What?

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:36.570
Follow me. I will show you more of Falam Orbius.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.630
What do you think?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.970
This is my planet.

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:44.080
The most prosperous planet in the galaxy.

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:48.420
Look!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:08.960
Tsurugi, I'm quite popular, don't you think?

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.360
Y-Yeah.

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.960
Minel, stop that boy's crying.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.790
It's not within my field of specialty...

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.170
I don't care.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.710
Do something about it at once.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:29.990
Understood.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:38.810
What are you doing?

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.950
He isn't stopping at all!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.970
Your Majesty, I am doing my best but...

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:46.690
N-Now! Cease your crying at once!

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.150
Oh, there you are!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:51.810
Mama!

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.360
Thank goodness!

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:00.490
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:05.190
My moment's negligence at keeping watch over my child has caused you trouble.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:07.000
Indeed, it has.

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:12.750
You have wasted a tremendous amount of Queen Lalaya's precious time.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.610
I beg your forgiveness!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:18.130
If you continue to cause any more unnecessary disturbances to Queen Lalaya-

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.720
Do not utter such nonsense!

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:24.260
I don't consider it a waste of my time at all.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.270
I love all of you.

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:31.810
And I want those I love to stay smiling always.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:34.780
I'm glad you have reunited with each other safely.

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.690
I am very happy for this.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.030
Let us continue to live with each other on such friendly terms.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.470
Queen Lalaya...

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:44.740
Thank you!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:56.450
So this is Lalaya's planet.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.680
What do you think, Tsurugi?

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:09.370
Have you taken a better liking to Falam Orbius?

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:10.600
I don't know about that.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.430
You still insist on refusing to see my planet's charm?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:18.910
I can see that it's far more advanced than Earth.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:21.570
Then you'll serve me?

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:24.570
Fine.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.290
Really?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:29.270
You're a smart one.

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:32.120
Then I will tell you what I want of you right away.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.170
Want of me?

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:36.130
I want you to become my husband!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:37.410
What?!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.960
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:55.120
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:58.860
Warp has ended.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.700
I wonder what the next planet is like.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.770
I bet we're not welcome, either way.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:09.830
We <i>are</i>  their enemy.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.830
Whoever loses gets kicked out of their home planet...

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:15.290
Tenma.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:19.710
The only thing we're capable of doing right now is playing soccer.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:24.180
We must fight each match with care as we look for a solution.

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:26.020
Okay!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.010
We will now be landing in Sazanaarah.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.370
How wonderful!

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:42.110
It's like an aquarium!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:42.820
Yeah!

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:46.440
That's an interesting-looking fish.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:48.870
That one looks like this planet's equivalent of Earth's fat greenling.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.330
Do you like it?

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.340
It's you again!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.610
Welcome to the water planet, Sazanaarah.

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:00.370
They live underwater, I see!

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:04.130
This planet has a view that is far more magnificent than the one you see here.

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:08.520
It is said to be a must-see tourist attraction whenever one visits Sazanaarah.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.010
I want to see it!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.550
So do I!

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:13.820
Then allow me to escort you.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:21.900
I wonder if one of the hope shards that Katora talked about can be found on this planet too...

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.890
What's wrong with the people on this planet?

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.250
For this number of people, they're abnormally quiet.

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:40.220
If I remember correctly, the Sazanaarahns possess a dangerous ability.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.750
Dangerous ability?

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:45.840
So each planet has their own unique specialty.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:47.550
Interesting.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.590
Everyone, be careful.

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:54.600
Be ready to return to Galaxy Nauts at a moment's notice, if anything happens.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:55.900
Yeah.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:04.860
Let's go, Pixie!

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.350
Hey!

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:07.590
Tenma.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:10.780
Tenma.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:12.930
Katora!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.500
Tenma.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.120
Huh?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.210
Huh?!

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:18.880
Katora!

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:22.960
Is it true that your planet Kieru was destroyed by a black hole?

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.370
Since you're here talking to me now, that can't be true, right?

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.220
Where are you?

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:33.480
You told me that there's a way to save everyone.

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.810
You have to tell me! How can we save everyone?!

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:42.690
When you arrive to where I am located, there I will tell you everything.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.660
Where is that?

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.040
If I go there, will I get to meet you?

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.660
In order to see me, you must keep winning.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:52.120
Winning means we'll be able to save everyone, right?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.400
Okay!

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:57.800
Then I'll win for sure and go to where you are!

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.710
If we get to where you are, we can save everyone!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.710
You trust what I'm telling you?

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:06.930
Yeah!

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:11.300
I just don't think that you're making false promises.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:12.800
I see.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.810
But why are you guiding us?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:22.100
Even though you won your previous match, you were still troubled.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:29.500
You felt sorrow for those who lost their future because you had won.

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:36.790
I believe that you just may be the one who will use our power correctly to save the galaxy.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.190
Me?

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.080
Katora!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:41.580
Wait, hold on! Katora!

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.590
Katora!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.040
I'm okay.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:52.880
Tenma!

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:56.110
What's wrong? You ran ahead all by yourself...

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:58.140
I just met her again.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:00.060
Her?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:00.890
Princess Katora?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.400
That can't be.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.880
No, Katora <i>is</i>  alive!

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:10.610
I saw my planet destroyed by the black hole with my own eyes!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:14.640
And I just talked with Katora face to face!

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:15.450
I believe she's still alive!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:22.460
There's not a chance that someone from a dead planet can still be alive...

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.300
They have us cornered.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.350
We <i>are</i>  their enemy after all.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.810
They're not even giving us a chance to run.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.770
So you're Earth Eleven?

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.840
Teach us what Earth's soccer is like.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.070
We're interested in seeing it.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.530
Tenma, the match is tomorrow.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.920
There's no need to show them our hand.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:55.780
I know.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.750
Show us the power that took down Sandorias.

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.960
They don't look as if they will allow you to leave until you've played a game with them.

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.870
And right before our important game...

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.550
Tenma, do you have a plan?

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:21.440
I think Matatagi and I should use combo plays to end this battle in one shot.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.220
Okay, Matatagi?

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:24.930
You got it, Captain.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.190
Leave the goalkeeping to me.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.760
I'll be defense.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:35.840
This is the perfect chance for me to analyze what special ability the Sazanaarahns have.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:39.060
As expected from one of Earth Eleven's data duo!

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:40.350
We've got our hopes on you guys!

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.950
I will join as well.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:47.040
The burden will be too great for Minaho-kun to handle alone, so I will help.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.790
I'm fine on my own...

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.670
Listen up, everyone.

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:54.870
We have a game that's more important than this one waiting for us.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.510
Whatever you do, don't push yourselves!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.010
Let's go!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:17:59.510
Okay!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.530
You can do it, Tenma!

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:08.980
Take that point and get this over with already!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.620
Get this over with, they said.

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:13.730
Oh, will they?

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:16.740
Let's go!

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.490
It's mine.

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.680
I made sure that pass would go through...

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.330
It happens.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.120
Yeah!

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:34.920
Your course is wide open.

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.460
Now's your chance!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.260
Mine again!

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:43.890
Captain!

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:46.350
Manabe!

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:51.400
How are they able to keep blocking our passes?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.270
I wonder what's wrong?

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.300
They aren't clicking together like they usually do.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:57.900
Here!

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.320
Pass that ball properly!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:01.870
Sorry, sorry!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.830
I'll take it right back.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.960
We won't have a chance if we don't attack!

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:08.960
Keep up the offense!

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:09.870
Okay!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.830
Let's go, Matatagi!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:12.830
Okay!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.930
Another pass cut!

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.300
Come on, Captain!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.840
It won't work no matter how many times you try.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.640
What the hell is Captain doing?

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:27.890
Anyone could have seen that pass coming!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.520
What is that...?

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:36.770
Playing this battle won't help me protect Yuuta and Shun.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:37.780
There's no point!

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.570
Make sure your passes go through!

00:19:46.570 --> 00:19:48.330
See what I get for going along with your stupidity!

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.620
See? Pretty amazing, huh?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.750
Earth has some interesting people there.

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.750
It's the first time I ever saw something like that.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:57.840
What's their problem?

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.670
You're incredible!

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:06.100
We're not doing anything out of the ordinary...

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.630
They're mocking us.

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:13.600
We just have to show them from here what we can really do!

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:19.340
Is that all you've got?

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:22.860
You've got balls for laughing at us when your shoots are pathetic.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.530
Manabe, strike back!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.070
Too bad.

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:28.620
Here I go!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.080
To the right!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.580
What?!

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.960
Tenma and the others... lost?

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:41.760
Damn it!

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.760
I didn't expect him to add in a feint!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.600
This game is set.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.680
These guys beat Sandorias? Must have been a fluke.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.730
It's not us who are going to be destroyed.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:53.310
It's you Earthlings.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.020
Damn it!

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:56.730
What?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.300
You're a lonely guy, I see.

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:07.990
It's no wonder you don't have any friends who care about you.

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.870
What's their problem?

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.560
What the hell would they know about me?!

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:58.600
The strange ability of the residents on the water planet makes Matatagi suffer.

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:00.850
What bitter past lurks within his heart?

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:03.570
Next, Matatagi Hayato's Darkness!

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:06.030
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:19.470
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.980
We won't have a chance if we don't attack!

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:26.210
That's all!
